{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10438","headline":"邯郸少年行 · 高适","name":"邯郸少年行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邯郸城南游侠子，自矜生长邯郸里。\n千塲纵博家仍富，几度报讐身不死。\n宅中歌笑日纷纷，门外车马常如云。\n未知肝胆向谁是，令人却忆平原君。\n君不见今人交态薄，黄金用尽还疎索。\n以兹感叹辞旧游，更於时事无所求。\n且与少年饮美酒，往来射猎西山头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10438.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10438","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}